request: Rename Todo.done to Todo.completed everywhere. --single

single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/format.ts, src/commands.test.ts, src/format.test.ts, src/storage.test.ts, src/types.test.ts  (Renamed Todo.done to Todo.completed in types.ts, commands.ts (add/complete/list) and format.ts, and updated the test fixtures to match. I left ListOptions.includeDone alone because it is a separate public option and the request only covers the Todo field. Note: storage.load casts JSON without checking it, so existing todos.json files that still use "done" will load as if nothing is completed. No migration was requested, so I didn't add one.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (Done. Todo.done is now Todo.completed everywhere, and tsc and all 10 tests pass. Existing todos.json files that still use "done" are not migrated, so those items will show as not completed.)

